vars : {
    d2-config : {
        layout-engine : tala
        theme-id : 1
        
    }
}
EEPROM I2C <-> FPGA
EEPROM I2C.shape : rectangle
EEPROM I2C : |`md
    ### EEPROM I2C
    |Señal|Pin|_|
    |-|-|-|
    |SCL | IOL32A|<-| 
    |SDA | IOL32B|<->|
`|

LCD MIPI.shape:rectangle
LCD MIPI <- FPGA
LCD MIPI :|`md
    ### LDC MIPI

    |Señal|Pin|Pin LVDS|
    |-|-|-|    
    |CLK_N|IOT19A|IOT48B|
    |CLK_P|IOT23A|IOT48A|
    |DATA 1_N|IOT22A|IOT42B|
    |DATA 1_P|IOT23B|IOT42A|
    |DATA 0_N|IOT27A|IOT40B|
    |DATA 0_P|IOT27B|IOT40A|                     
`|

MCU CH32V -> FPGA
USB -> MCU CH32V

Cartucho : {
    Dirección_0 <- _.FPGA
    Dirección_0 : |`md
        | Señal | Pin    |
        |-------|--------|
        | A0    | IOB40A |
        | A1    | IOB40B |
        | A2    | IOB42A |
        | A3    | IOB42B |
        | A4    | IOB48A |
        | A5    | IOB48B |
        | A6    | IOB53A |        
    `|
    Dirección_1 <- _.FPGA
    Dirección_1 : |`md
        | Señal | Pin    |
        |-------|--------|
        | A7    | IOB53B |
        | A8    | IOB55B |
        | A9    | IOR50B |
        | A10   | IOR50A |
        | A11   | IOR49B |
        | A12   | IOR49A |
        | A13   | IOR45A |
        | A14   | IOR42A |
        | A15   | IOR42A |
    `|
    Datos <-> _.FPGA
    Datos : |`md
        | Señal | Pin    |
        |-------|--------|
        | D0    | IOB12B |
        | D1    | IOB12A |
        | D2    | IOB7B  |
        | D3    | IOB7A  |
        | D4    | IOB6B  |
        | D5    | IOB6A  |
        | D6    | IOB5B  |
        | D7    | IOB5A  |
        
    `|

    Control <- _.FPGA
    Control : |`md
        | Señal | Pin    |
        |-------|--------|
        | CLK   | IOB34A |
        | N_WR  | IOB34B |
        | N_RD  | IOB38A |
        | N_CS  | IOB38B |
        |OE     | IOB17A |  
    `|
}


Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up) -> FPGA
Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up).shape : rectangle
Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up): |`md

    ### Pulsadores(Internal Pull-up)

    |Señal|Pin|
    |-|-|
    |A|  IOB20B|
    |B | IOB20A|
    |START|  IOR27B|
    |SELECT|  IOR27A|
    |RIGHT|  IOR22B|
    |UP|  IOR20B|
    |DOWN|  IOR22A|
    |LEFT_|  IOR20A|
    
    `|

Flash SPI.shape : rectangle
Flash SPI <-> FPGA
Flash SPI : |`md
    ### Flash SPI
    |Señal|Pin|_|
    |-|-|-|
    |CLK |IOR34B|<-|
    |N_CS(Pull-up)|IOR34A|<-|
    |DI(Pull-up)|IOR33B|<-|
    |DO(Pull-up)| IOR33A|->|
`|

GB Link.shape : rectangle
GB Link <-> FPGA
GB Link : |`md

    ### GB Link

    |Señal|Pin|-|
    |-|-|-|
    |Serial Out|IOL33B|<-|
    |Serial In|IOL33A|->|
    |CLK|IOL36B|<-|
    |CLK_OE|IOL36A|<-|
`|

Control Volumen.shape : rectangle
Control Volumen -> FPGA
Control Volumen : |`md
    ### Control Volumen
    
    |Señal|Pin|
    |-|-|
    |Subir|
    |Bajar|
    |Botón|
`|